  hostId?: string;
  // Thread id to wait for.
  threadId: string;
}>;
  // Maximum event-wait time in milliseconds. A bounded snapshot fetch for fresh progress may add latency. Defaults to 120000.
  timeoutMs?: number;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

